{"id":"wb-5-73","name":"番国故城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"番国故城遗址","text":"番国故城遗址是一座东周时期古城遗址，位于中国河南省固始县城北。是中国国务院公布的第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n1978年春，在遗址东南1.5公里处的侯古堆一号墓陪葬坑出土的一套编钟上铸有“番子臣周”铭文，为番国器物。\n现时开发方面，固始城北遗址范围内辟有古城公园，免费向市民开放。另外固始城区沿遗址西侧有一条南北向街道，名为古城路，亦得名于此遗址。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%95%AA%E5%9B%BD%E6%95%85%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":90815945,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90815945","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/194a63e38f701e9f52a45a5c.jpg","title":"Relics_of_Pan_State.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Relics_of_Pan_State.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/Relics_of_Pan_State.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"芃瑶","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​番国故城遗址南端景观，摄于固始县蓼北路","width":320,"height":240}}